gaRa(){return"Two lines, one trail"},
gaR9(){return"If another trail lies roughly alongside, \u201cIs a duplicate \u2026\u201d appears below the export. You choose which one stays; your recordings, your contribution and your reports move there. \u201cSeparate\u201d undoes it."},
gaQZ(){return"Watch again"},
gaQY(){return"Here you restart the tours for trails and buddies; below, the tour for splitting a ride."},
gaQB(){return"In \u201cMy rides\u201d"},
